        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="6" column="1">
        <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="aoiHardwareUpdateShiftSpin">
         <property name="decimals"><number>1</number></property>
         <property name="minimum"><double>0.500000000000000</double></property>
         <property name="maximum"><double>2000.000000000000000</double></property>
         <property name="value"><double>16.000000000000000</double></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="7" column="0">
        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelAoiHardwareUpdateCooldown">
         <property name="text"><string>硬件 AOI 更新冷却时间（ms）</string></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="7" column="1">
        <widget class="QSpinBox" name="aoiHardwareUpdateCooldownSpin">
         <property name="maximum"><number>600000</number></property>
         <property name="value"><number>1000</number></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="8" column="0">
        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelAoiMinimumPeakDistance">
         <property name="text"><string>候选最小间距基准（px）</string></property>
         <property name="toolTip"><string>两个候选连通域质心的实际最小距离为该值的 2 倍。</string></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="8" column="1">
        <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="aoiMinimumPeakDistanceSpin">
         <property name="toolTip"><string>两个候选连通域质心的实际最小距离为该值的 2 倍。</string></property>
         <property name="decimals"><number>1</number></property>
         <property name="minimum"><double>1.000000000000000</double></property>
         <property name="maximum"><double>500.000000000000000</double></property>
         <property name="value"><double>8.000000000000000</double></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="9" column="0">
        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelAoiMaximumDifferentialJump">
         <property name="text"><string>双星差分最大跳变量（px）</string></property>
         <property name="toolTip"><string>相邻有效帧的双星差分跳变，以及相对短窗口中值基线的偏离阈值；不会重置测量窗口。</string></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item row="9" column="1">
        <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="aoiMaximumDifferentialJumpSpin">
         <property name="toolTip"><string>单帧突变会立即隔离；短窗口基线偏离使用下方连续帧数判定，不会重置测量窗口。</string></property>
         <property name="decimals"><number>1</number></property>
         <property name="minimum"><double>0.5</double></property>
         <property name="maximum"><double>2000.0</double></property>
         <property name="value"><double>10.0</double></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item row="10" column="0">
        <widget class="QLabel" name="labelAoiDifferentialBaselineViolationFrames">
         <property name="text"><string>差分基线连续偏离帧数</string></property>
         <property name="toolTip"><string>相对最近 20 个有效双星差分中值超过差分阈值时，连续达到该帧数才拒绝；正常整体平移不会改变双星差分。</string></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item row="10" column="1">
        <widget class="QSpinBox" name="aoiDifferentialBaselineViolationFramesSpin">
         <property name="toolTip"><string>连续达到该帧数后才拒绝差分基线偏离，默认 5 帧。</string></property>
         <property name="minimum"><number>1</number></property>
         <property name="maximum"><number>10000</number></property>
         <property name="value"><number>5</number></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item row="11" column="0" colspan="2">
         <widget class="QLabel" name="labelAoiHelp">
          <property name="text"><string>每帧在两个候选质心周围使用最终质心核计算强度加权质心；默认半径 3，即 7 × 7，修改半径后边长为 2r + 1。只在质心核接近 AOI 边界时更新硬件 AOI，并受最小移动量和冷却时间限制。候选最小间距基准的实际双星距离阈值为它的 2 倍。差分跳变量用于拒绝单帧突变；差分基线连续偏离达到设定帧数后才拒绝渐变漂移。拒绝样本不会进入 r0 窗口，且不会清空已有测量窗口。性能目标仅用于诊断，不会为了满足 300 × 300 px 而裁掉星点。</string></property>
         <property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
